      "content": "Here's a possible draft paragraph: \n\n\"[Executive's Name] has consistently exceeded expectations in her role as Senior Account Executive, demonstrating exceptional skill in client retention and account management. Her ability to maintain stable client relationships and drive results has been impressive, and I appreciate her efforts in this area. However, I wanted to touch base with you about your participation in the morning stand-up meetings. While I value your contributions to internal discussions, I've noticed a delay in your attendance, which may impact our team's ability to work collaboratively and collectively. Can we discuss strategies for improving your morning routine to ensure you're fully prepared and engaged in our meetings?\"",
