      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. I think the part about the meetings feels a little bit too soft, though. It sounds more like a suggestion than a formal piece of feedback. Can we make it sound a bit more serious? I want them to understand that being late is actually a problem for the team's workflow, even if their client work is great. Maybe something that emphasizes the impact of their absence on the rest of the group?",
