      "content": "That's much better, it hits the right note of being firm without being rude. One last thing though—I want to make sure they don't just see this as a \"minor annoyance\" and ignore it. Can you add a sentence at the end that hints at the idea that consistent attendance is a core part of being a senior leader in this company? Like, something about how leadership requires setting a standard for the rest of the team?",
      "source": "evaluator"
